                                                            <p class="brfprofile">

                                                                <b>Brief Profile:</b><br>

                                                                Virendra Vikram is an Assistant Professor at GNIOT
                                                                Institute
                                                                of Manageemnt Studies. He is
                                                                currently pursuing his Ph.D. in the area of Health
                                                                Insurance
                                                                Marketing in India from
                                                                Department of Management Studies at Guru Ghasidas
                                                                Vishwavidyalaya, Bilaspur. His
                                                                research focuses on marketing strategies in health
                                                                insurance, consumer purchase intention,
                                                                service quality dimensions, and public policy
                                                                implications
                                                                in the Indian health financing
                                                                system.<br>
                                                                He has academic and industry exposure spanning financial
                                                                services, ed-tech, and travel
                                                                services, strengthening his understanding of consumer
                                                                decision-making and relationship
                                                                management in service industries. He has teaching
                                                                experience
                                                                as a Guest Lecturer at
                                                                Government College Balrampur and follows a
                                                                research-oriented
                                                                approach in management
                                                                education.<br>
                                                                His research interests include Health Insurance
                                                                Marketing,
                                                                7Ps of Service Marketing,
                                                                Structural Equation Modeling (SEM), Consumer Behaviour,
                                                                Public Health Policy, and Digital
                                                                Promotion Strategies in Insurance.<br>

